1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
You might think: I would never follow wrong AI advice. The brain data says otherwise.

2
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:05,100
MIT EEG study: 54 participants. Three conditions. Brain-only, Search, LLM.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:08,100
In session four, LLM users switched to brain-only. Connectivity remained under-engaged.

4
00:00:07,033 --> 00:00:10,033
LLM users struggled to quote their own essays minutes later. The words did not feel like theirs.

